{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-10",
  "title": "Wake From a Long Dream",
  "storyCode": "15-11",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1c9c78a6b5c59c5a28552beea9de134fcbcf83d0f23733d2fba808b81fdf515b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston does not understand why his daughter chose this as their meeting place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "This is no vacation spot. Too much sand in one's shoes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "I should take a break.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He sits on a dune and removes his shoes, only for the wind to send the sand he pours out into his face."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "This is most undignified—why am I in full dress?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "Why did she ask me to come here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is no answer on the radio. He wanders aimlessly on the yellow sands, calling his daughter's name.\nNo one answers until night has fallen."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "...A party?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He follows the sound to find the camp on the dunes in the distance, filled with lights and ribbons.\nHe hears his daughter's familiar laughter, and runs towards her in joy."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Daughter'",
      "text": "You made it to my wedding, dad!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston almost cries at the sight of the golden hair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "I've been looking for you for so long, my sunshine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "Is this your wedding?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Daughter'",
      "text": "Of course. The ceremony is about to start. Let's go.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Daughter'",
      "text": "We'll walk the red carpet, arm in arm. Give me your blessings, dad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston tries to take her arm, but he can not reach it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Daughter'",
      "text": "Will you not give me your blessing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "No... no, that’s not what I meant... I—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown Language) I—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Disjointed Voice",
      "text": "Will you not give me your blessing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown Language) ...Sunshine?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kristen",
      "text": "You did not want us to see the truth of the stars?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) ...You're not my sunshine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) Have I left home? I remember this bunker—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) 'The preservation room'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kristen",
      "text": "You will not answer any more of my questions?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) Kristen. You're Kristen...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) I've heard of you. No, I've seen you... no. How did I know you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) I've never known you—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trevor Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) Who the devil turned off the light?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston",
      "text": "(Unknown language) Damn it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston",
      "text": "Why have you imprisoned me here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "Closure! Is this another one of your damned jokes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston realizes that he is buried in the 'photos' that fill the room. A volume of 'A Complete Bestiary of Terra' covers his camera module.\nAre they even photos? He has never visited the places in them, nor could he ever.\nThere are only fragmented images on the countless photos.\nSand dune, bonfire, camp, golden hair, and the preservation room where the sun does not shine."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "A dream...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Friston dreamed. Friston-3 dreamed.\nHe printed his own dream."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "It should not be possible for me to dream. Did Closure upload a new firmware without telling me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "I don't have time to argue with you right now, Mr. Friston!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "I guarantee you in the strongest possible terms that I have not uploaded any firmware that could have caused you to dream.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "The PRTS anomalies are getting out of control. It will take time to deploy the backup command system.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "All the work has to be assigned manually. I wish I had six or seven pairs of eyes! We've completely lost contact with some areas and we have no idea what's going on—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "Relax, Closure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "I'm not trying to argue with you. I just want to make sure that all possibilities for my unusual malfunctions are accounted for.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "We've eliminated firmware bugs and hardware malfunctions as possibilities. Then—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "Answer me, Closure... this is important...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "What is the energy source that powers my core?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Huh? Originium, of course.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "Are the majority of your retrofitted operation platforms Originium-powered?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "...Your tone is starting to scare me, Mr. Friston. What are you trying to say?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "You're a genius, Closure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friston-3",
      "text": "Excellent thinking, cutting off the link between the retrofitted operation platforms and PRTS. But that's not enough, not by a long shot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Huh? What's going on? Why are things shaking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Popukar was awakened by the continuous flashing. She looks out of the porthole, but sees nothing unusual outside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Looks like a nice day. No sign of rain.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Maybe somebody was training noisily outside?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Hm... PRTS comms are still down?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Looks like today's assignment is in the isolation zone outside the ship. I should report to Orchid.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Morning—hey, where did everybody go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "It's so quiet... where is Orchid? I can't reach her...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "I should check the cafeteria.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "The cafeteria's... this way—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Popukar's sleepy eyes are only half-open, but she could find her way from the deck to the cafeteria even if they were completely shut.\nThat is how well she knows Rhodes Island—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Wh-Whoa, whoaaaa!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "O-Ouch, that hurts...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is tripped by a toolbox from the Engineering Department left in the corridor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "I thought Engineering was done with working in this area...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "So careless!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She kneels down to rub her knee, which doesn't hurt so much anymore, then puts the scattered tools and boxes away to the sides of the corridor."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "That light again... what...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Popukar stands up and looks to the porthole next to her—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She sees many strange people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Who are they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "New visitors...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "The other side of the porthole is supposed to be the deck. Are these people lost?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She walks briskly through the corridor, but begins to slow down as she becomes increasingly confused."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Why do I see them on every porthole?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "O-Orchid? This is Popukar.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Seems like communications are still down. I don't know if I'm getting through to you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Are you seeing anything weird?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "There is no response from the communicator."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faint Voice Outside the Porthole",
      "text": "(Unknown language) When true destruction... on me... powerless...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faint Voice Outside the Porthole",
      "text": "(Unknown language) Equal end...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "A-Are they talking? I can't hear...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Th-The mission comes first. Maybe Orchid is already waiting for me in the isolation zone outside.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "A left turn here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Go straight, then push the door open...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Then the exit passage—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Let me get to the ground first...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "I think I'm here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Popukar turns around to look at the exit passage that she came out of, only to find that it has disappeared."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "——?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Orchid",
      "text": "Popukar! We were looking for you. Everyone else is here—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Orchid",
      "text": "Is something wrong?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "O-Orchid... is the exit passage here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Orchid",
      "text": "What exit passage?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "—*Bzzt* All operators... receiving this message...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Do not... trust...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "Communications... blocked... Rhodes Island... awake...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Closure",
      "text": "—Repeat... *Bzzt* Warning—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Popukar",
      "text": "...Closure?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "(Advances hesitantly)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pained 'Beepy'",
      "text": "(Hostile posture)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "I'm sorry, little fella, but I can't let you hurt anyone else.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pained 'Beepy'",
      "text": "(Spins angrily)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "Why did you attack us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "I'm not sure what's going on, but something must be wrong with the ship.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "You went missing for a while, and this is what became of you when you came back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "Besides, the structure of the ship seems to be changing. I could hardly find my way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "Such a strange feeling. It's like... like the ship is—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alanna",
      "text": "Like it's alive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Are we being attacked?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Impossible... we had set up an isolation zone around Rhodes Island. We should have gotten a warning if any enemies had approached.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Unless... the enemy was from within.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I'm not sure... we're in the command center, but we're not getting any information about what's going on anywhere on the ship!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "No response from Dr. Kal'tsit or any of the elite operators to our messages, either...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'll go find them.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Let's get everyone together. Then we can think about how to deal with this.",
          "value": "2",
